# lab_fire7 (Spec 11.33 fire method comparison, user 2026-10-16 "다양한 방식을 시도해보고 그 중 맞는 걸 선택"): 노 four times in one lab
# Play, one variant each (SwingProbe308 fxset: a fire6 baseline | b painted sheet | c soot-mixed sheet, smoke off | d painted, low and
# wide). 0.35x, shot + side at three moments per cast, fx probe after each.
call SpellLab308 Run build
sleep 3
call Oheangbu.EditorTools.SpellVFX120.Vfx308Build Run build
sleep 3
call SpellLab308 Run play
wait lab
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:6
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:0.35
?call SwingProbe308 Run fxset:a
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 0.45
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7a_3
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7a_3
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.25
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7a_4
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7a_4
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.40
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7a_5
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7a_5
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 6
?call SwingProbe308 Run fxset:b
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 0.45
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7b_3
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7b_3
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.25
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7b_4
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7b_4
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.40
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7b_5
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7b_5
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 6
?call SwingProbe308 Run fxset:c
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 0.45
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7c_3
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7c_3
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.25
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7c_4
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7c_4
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.40
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7c_5
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7c_5
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 6
?call SwingProbe308 Run fxset:d
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 0.45
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7d_3
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7d_3
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.25
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7d_4
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7d_4
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.40
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire7d_5
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire7d_5
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 6
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:1
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run report
mem
finally:
?call SpellLab308 Run stop
sleep 6
